<title>FINLAND: EU'S DE SILGUY TO VISIT FINLAND APRIL 10-13.</title>
<headline>EU'S DE SILGUY TO VISIT FINLAND APRIL 10-13.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Monetary Affairs Commissioner Yves Thibault de Silguy will visit Finland April 10-13 at the invitation of Finance Minister Sauli Niinisto, the finance ministry said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>De Silguy will also meet Prime Minister Paavo Lipponen.</p>
<p>On April 11 at 1215/0915 GMT, de Silguy and Niinisto will hold a joint news conference, the ministry said.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
